      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "I — The Set",
      "estimated_duration_s": 18,
      "narration_text": "There are twenty of these patterns in total. Part one covers the first six — the structural ones, the bedrock everything else sits on. Three of them change what runs: chaining, routing, parallelization. Three change how it thinks: reflection, tool use, planning. Every one of them is a trade.",
