    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "III — How It Thinks",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "Reflection is a generator and a critic in a loop. The generator drafts, the critic grades it against a rubric, the generator revises. Quality goes up. So does the cost — every cycle is another two calls. And without a limit, the loop simply never ends. Cap it at two or three passes, keep the best draft, and hand it to a human.",
      "new_visual_element": "Reflection — the critic loop and its circuit breaker",
