      "act": "III — How It Thinks",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "Tool use is how an agent touches the outside world — a database, a search, a calculator. It finds the tool, checks that it is allowed to use it, then calls it. The failure mode is that models hallucinate parameters. So the permission check is not paperwork, it is the safety layer. Read-only credentials, validated inputs, and human approval for anything destructive.",
